---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import ContactCTA from '../../components/ContactCTA.astro';
import GoogleBusinessInfo from '../../components/GoogleBusinessInfo.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';

const title = 'Iowa Drain Cleaning | A-1 Drain Cleaning';
const description = 'A-1 Drain Cleaning provides drain cleaning and sewer line service across Iowa. Call 641-530-2728 for clogged drains, floor drain backups, and sewer problems.';
---

<MainLayout title={title} description={description} path="/iowa-drain-cleaning/">
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="bg-[#1A1A68] text-white">
      <div class="container grid gap-10 py-14 sm:py-18 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr] lg:items-center lg:py-20">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-red-300">A-1 Drain Cleaning • Mason City, Iowa</p>
          <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-black leading-[.98] tracking-tight sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">Iowa Drain Cleaning for Homes and Businesses</h1>
          <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-200 sm:text-xl">A-1 Drain Cleaning is based in Mason City and handles drain and sewer problems throughout Iowa. We clear clogged drains and sewer lines, including main drain blockages, floor drain backups, kitchen and bathroom drains, laundry drains, and sewer lines affected by roots.</p>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-slate-200">If you need drain cleaning or sewer service, or want a different opinion about a problem with your drains or sewer, call A-1 Drain Cleaning or fill out the request service form. Tell us your town and what the drain or sewer is doing so we can discuss the problem and your location.</p>
          <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="mt-8 inline-block rounded-md bg-[#c52b34] px-7 py-4 text-center text-lg font-black text-white hover:bg-[#a82129]">CALL 641-530-2728</a>
          <p class="mt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300">Drain cleaning • Sewer line clearing • Root cutting • Hydro-jetting • 24/7 service</p>
        </div>
        <aside class="border border-white/15 bg-white/10 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-red-200">Start with the symptoms</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black leading-tight">Where is the water backing up?</h2>
          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-slate-200">
            <li class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4"><strong class="text-white">Basement floor drain:</strong> fills or overflows when water is used elsewhere in the house.</li>
            <li class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4"><strong class="text-white">Laundry:</strong> washer water rises in the standpipe or comes out of a nearby floor drain.</li>
            <li class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4"><strong class="text-white">Kitchen or bathroom:</strong> a sink, tub, or shower drains slowly or stops.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-white">Main sewer:</strong> several fixtures back up together, or wastewater appears in the lowest fixture.</li>
          </ul>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white py-14 sm:py-18">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Drain and sewer service</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 max-w-4xl text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">Drain cleaning starts with finding where the blockage is.</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">One slow sink may have a blockage in its own drain. When several fixtures are affected, a toilet flush causes another drain to rise, or wastewater comes up through a floor drain, the restriction may be farther down a shared line or the main sewer. The pattern helps determine where to start.</p>
        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950"><a href="/services/main-drain-cleaning/" class="hover:text-[#b4232b]">Main Drain Cleaning</a></h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">For a stopped or backed-up main drain affecting more than one fixture.</p>
            <a href="/services/main-drain-cleaning/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Read service details →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950"><a href="/services/sewer-line-cleaning/" class="hover:text-[#b4232b]">Sewer Line Cleaning</a></h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">For sewer line blockages and drainage problems that keep coming back.</p>
            <a href="/services/sewer-line-cleaning/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Read service details →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950"><a href="/services/basement-floor-drains/" class="hover:text-[#b4232b]">Basement &amp; Floor Drains</a></h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">For water or sewage rising through a floor drain.</p>
            <a href="/services/basement-floor-drains/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Read service details →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950"><a href="/services/kitchen-drains/" class="hover:text-[#b4232b]">Kitchen Drains</a></h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">For kitchen sinks, kitchen drain lines, garbage disposals, and dishwasher drain problems.</p>
            <a href="/services/kitchen-drains/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Read service details →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950"><a href="/services/bathroom-shower-drains/" class="hover:text-[#b4232b]">Bathroom &amp; Shower Drains</a></h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">For bathroom sinks, showers, tubs, and related drain backups.</p>
            <a href="/services/bathroom-shower-drains/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Read service details →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950"><a href="/services/laundry-drains/" class="hover:text-[#b4232b]">Laundry &amp; Washing Machine Drains</a></h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">For a washer standpipe overflowing or water coming up through a floor drain during a drain cycle.</p>
            <a href="/services/laundry-drains/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Read service details →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950"><a href="/services/toilet-clogs/" class="hover:text-[#b4232b]">Toilet Clogs &amp; Problems</a></h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">For toilet clogs and toilet symptoms that may be connected to a larger drain problem.</p>
            <a href="/services/toilet-clogs/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Read service details →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950"><a href="/services/tree-roots-in-sewer-line/" class="hover:text-[#b4232b]">Tree Roots in Sewer Lines</a></h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">For recurring sewer blockages where roots may be entering the line.</p>
            <a href="/services/tree-roots-in-sewer-line/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Read service details →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950"><a href="/services/hydro-jetting/" class="hover:text-[#b4232b]">Hydro-Jetting</a></h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">Water-jet cleaning for suitable drain and sewer lines when the pipe and blockage call for it.</p>
            <a href="/services/hydro-jetting/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Read service details →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950"><a href="/services/sewer-backup-into-tub-shower/" class="hover:text-[#b4232b]">Sewer Backup into a Tub or Shower</a></h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">In homes without basements, a blocked main line can show up in a tub or shower instead of a floor drain.</p>
            <a href="/services/sewer-backup-into-tub-shower/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Read service details →</a>
          </article>
        </div>
        <a href="/services/" class="mt-8 inline-flex rounded-md bg-[#1A1A68] px-6 py-3 font-black text-white hover:bg-slate-800">See all drain &amp; sewer services</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-slate-100 py-14 sm:py-18">
      <div class="container grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:items-start">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Iowa service area</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">Based in Mason City. Serving customers across Iowa.</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-700">A-1 Drain Cleaning is based in Mason City and takes drain and sewer calls throughout Iowa. The Iowa towns shown below are examples of communities with local information on this site, not a limit on where A-1 Drain Cleaning can take a call. If you need drain cleaning or sewer service, call or fill out the request service form and tell us where you are located.</p>
          <a href="/service-area/" class="mt-5 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">View the service-area map and towns →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          <a href="/mason-city-drain-cleaning/" class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Mason City, Iowa</a>
          <a href="/service-area/clear-lake/" class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Clear Lake, Iowa</a>
          <a href="/service-area/charles-city/" class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Charles City, Iowa</a>
          <a href="/service-area/forest-city/" class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Forest City, Iowa</a>
          <a href="/service-area/hampton/" class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Hampton, Iowa</a>
          <a href="/service-area/northwood/" class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Northwood, Iowa</a>
          <a href="/service-area/nora-springs/" class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Nora Springs, Iowa</a>
          <a href="/service-area/garner/" class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Garner, Iowa</a>
          <a href="/service-area/rockwell/" class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Rockwell, Iowa</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white py-14 sm:py-18" aria-labelledby="iowa-drain-faq">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Common drain questions</p>
        <h2 id="iowa-drain-faq" class="mt-2 max-w-4xl text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">Drain cleaning and sewer backup answers</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 space-y-3">
          <details class="border border-slate-300 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer text-lg font-black text-slate-950">What should I do if sewage comes up through a floor drain?</summary>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-4xl leading-7 text-slate-700">Stop using toilets, sinks, showers, and the washing machine as much as possible so more water does not add to the backup. Keep children and pets away from wastewater. Call A-1 Drain Cleaning at <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="font-bold text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-2">641-530-2728</a> and explain which fixtures were being used when it happened.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="border border-slate-300 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer text-lg font-black text-slate-950">What if my home does not have a basement?</summary>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-4xl leading-7 text-slate-700">In a slab house or a home without a basement, a blocked main drain or sewer line may cause wastewater to rise into a bathtub or shower. Tell us which fixture backed up first and whether other drains are affected.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="border border-slate-300 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer text-lg font-black text-slate-950">Why does my washing machine cause water to come out of a drain?</summary>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-4xl leading-7 text-slate-700">A washing machine pumps out water quickly. If the laundry drain or a shared line cannot carry it away, water can rise in the standpipe or come up through a nearby floor drain. Stop running the washer until the drain is checked.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="border border-slate-300 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer text-lg font-black text-slate-950">How can I tell whether the problem is a local drain or the main sewer line?</summary>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-4xl leading-7 text-slate-700">One slow sink or tub may have a blockage in its own drain. Several fixtures backing up together, or wastewater appearing at the lowest drain, can point to a restriction farther down a shared line. These are clues, not a diagnosis; describe what you see when you call.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="border border-slate-300 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer text-lg font-black text-slate-950">Does A-1 Drain Cleaning provide service at night or on weekends?</summary>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-4xl leading-7 text-slate-700">A-1 Drain Cleaning offers 24/7 drain and sewer service. Call <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="font-bold text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-2">641-530-2728</a> and explain the backup or blockage.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <ContactCTA showForm />
    <GoogleBusinessInfo />
  </main>
  <Footer />
</MainLayout>
